> * individual name, or lack thereof
> * B/U/C status
> * Enchantment level
> * type of dagger (orcish, runed, "plain", silver, ...)

In addition to these real differencies, the identification level also
matters. (At least in vanilla Nethack, but I expect this to be the same
thing in slash'em and all other variants.)
If you character knows (so that you can see it in the inventory listing)
the enchantment level / B/U/C status of one individual identical dagger
and not the same things of another one of the exactly same kind, they
don't stack together. 

